        "description": "In a solar system fracturing under expansion, your mech is your lifeline. Reach out and use every switch and control to outmaneuver and overwhelm the enemy with 40 tons of precision. The battlefield is a shifting code, and adaptation is key. \n{1572799036680108}\nEvery component in your mech, and how you choose to build and modify it, can mean life or death. Form an elite 4v4 squad across all platforms. Strap in and join the Rebellion!\n{1267730347693941}\nNo extra gear needed—just your VR headset. We built this for the next generation of cockpit enthusiasts. Reach out, grab the sticks, flip the switches, and if things go south, hit the big red button.\n{1114586743387378}\nIron Rebellion is built by a small and passionate indie team. Your voice matters! If you have any questions or recommendations, feel free to reach out directly on \nDiscord: https://discord.gg/WJKSETT\n{1180527426954687}",
